      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This happens automatically if the instance is full. It will load you into the instance for a split second, and then kick you back to the loading screen to create a new instance.\nI know that this used to happen if somebody who had you blocked was in that particular instance, but I don't think that happens anymore.\nDo you think any of those two applied? If not, are you able to re-produce the bug? What region were you trying to join? How is your ping?",
